  "title": "Steak Mix-Up",
  "description": "Sirloin steak strips are sauteed with garlic and onion powders and chopped onions. Chili or bell peppers, diced tomatoes, condensed cream of mushroom soup, and milk are added and simmered for 10 to 15 minutes.",
